Significance: patch
Type: fixed

The editor canvas draws the block's Display Format. A Link block shows the link and a QR block shows the code, instead of both showing the button. The canvas also honours the Button Text setting, prints the "Powered by PayPal" line and lists variant options the way the published block does. The PayPal wordmark comes off the button face on both sides, and the QR code under the button is gone — the QR format draws one instead.
